，我们先不急着找答案。考试之后那段时间，你每天最明显的感觉是什么样的？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1926,"promptTokens":2375,"completionTokens":91,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:21:58"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":11,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004069603426519693,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af68256f4429d1fd72f8398","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794540118603,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:21:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af68256f4429d1fd72f8398","chatId":"c43876ce1b234887981d794ca1444699","sessionId":null,"userId":99909,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"可能是开学以后吧……我也记不太清。就是考试之后，好像更明显了，但具体为什么，我也讲不上来。<第5轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":10,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004069603426519693,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":2,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":2,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":1,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af68256f4429d1fd72f8399","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794540118600,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:21:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":nul